{"id":"selber","lemma":"selber","pos":"pron","rank":780,"glosses":["self (as in myself, yourself, himself etc.)","by oneself, on one's own, alone"],"ipa":"/ˈzɛlbər/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9a/De-selber2.ogg/De-selber2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich muss es selber machen.","en":"I have to do it myself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756302","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Das kannst du selber ändern.","en":"You can change that yourself.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to change, to alter"}]},{"text":"Ich hätte es selber tun sollen.","en":"I should've done it by myself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593329","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to do"},{"g":"should"}]},{"text":"Sie haben das selber oft gesagt.","en":"You've often said so yourself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593198","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"often"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]},{"text":"Hast du das alles selber gemacht?","en":"Did you make that all by yourself?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"everything"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]}]}